/// PROOF-CARRYING DSU — the SINGLE-USE HANDOFF NONCE obligation, Rung 1b (live wiring)
/// of `docs/RFC-proof-carrying-dsu.md`.
///
/// The seamless update-apply authenticates the inherited PTY-master fd map with a
