    /// `stage_act` (guard `stage=0`) sets `stage := stage_rhs`; `leak_act` (guard
    /// caller-supplied) sets `leak := leak_rhs`. The RHS exprs let the leak fire on a
    /// stage VALUE (secrecy) OR on `Buggy` directly (reply-fidelity).
